  "timing": "Summed device kernel durations on stream 7, in milliseconds per rank per profiled optimizer update. CUDA driver/runtime activity is linked by correlation to enclosing CompiledFunction and CompiledFunctionBackward CPU scopes. GPU memset and memcpy events, host gaps, cuDNN attention kernels and the gradient-join kernel are excluded. Rank medians and paired rank differences are descriptive statistics for this profiled update.",
  "sections": {
    "matched_total": "Disjoint sum of forward, selective activation checkpoint replay, backward-input preparation and post-SDPA backward. Includes matching projection GEMMs and common projection/norm work.",
    "forward": "From the earliest of the Q and KV-A projection GEMM launches, inclusive, to the start of aten::_scaled_dot_product_cudnn_attention. One launch for each of Q, KV-A and KV-B is required. Earliest projection serves as the anchor since SAC may schedule Q after KV preparation.",
    "replay": "The same start and end in CompiledFunctionBackward before recomputed SDPA.",
    "backward_inputs": "One corresponding Inductor SDPA-backward preparation fusion per MLA site, between the recomputed SDPA forward call and the SDPA backward call. Original and combined carry the same non-RoPE work and differ in the cat/expand work absorbed by the separate pack.",
    "backward": "From the end of aten::_scaled_dot_product_cudnn_attention_backward to the attention input-gradient join feeding the gated-norm backward (first triton_poi_fused_*add_cute_gated_norm_bwd_view_*). The join itself is excluded.",
    "backward_rotary_and_qkv_a_packing": "Subset of backward for inverse RoPE, dQ layout reconstruction and concat of the original shared rotary-key gradient with the KV-A latent gradient. Baseline has seven launches (shared-K sum/transpose/cast, conjugate, two complex multiplies, Q slice/cast, dQ cat, and dKV-A cat). Combined has two launches (_mla_rope_unpack and corresponding dKV-A cat, identified by its output grid and placement before the same downstream projection). This subset is already in matched_total."
  },
